{
  "description": "Generic classify-with-feedback instrument — items are presented one at a time, the learner picks a category from an ordered stacked-backdrop ladder, the pick is verdicted against the item's declared correct category with feedback and a running score, and the learner advances to the next item. Category and item vocabulary is entirely config-declared, so the same mechanism serves any classification domain (needs hierarchies, checks-and-balances, sociological imagination, and beyond) on a biology-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
